  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Pipeline status \u2014 metrics missing",
      "id": 9001,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Service e2e metrics not ingested (BLOCKED)\n\nThis dashboard expects:\n\n- `app_e2e_last_result{environment,service_name}`\n- `app_e2e_last_success_timestamp{environment}`\n- `app_e2e_test_duration_seconds{environment}`\n\nwith `service_name` in `{stac,openeo,jupyterhub-example,jupyterhub-eopf,openstack,s2-datacube}` (panels hard-code `environment=\"dev\"`).\n\n**Victoria Metrics has 0 `app_e2e_*` series.** Datasource UID was also `default` (fixed below \u2192 `victoria-metrics`); that alone cannot populate panels without the exporter.\n\n**Ask your Access / app team:** migrate the multi-service e2e job that used to push these metrics (old infra Prometheus / pushgateway) to OTLP \u2192 `https://otel.yourdomain.tld`.\n",
        "code": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      },
      "transparent": false
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoria-metrics"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "displayName": "${__field.labels.service_name}",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "dark-green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "minVizHeight": 75,
        "minVizWidth": 75,
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": false,
        "sizing": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.1.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "app_e2e_last_result{environment=\"dev\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service.name}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Service Status",
      "type": "gauge"
